p;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Excess cash generated from operations of the Parent&#8217;s subsidiaries that is not required to meet certain regulatory requirements may be periodically distributed to the Parent in the form of a distribution, although the amounts of such distributions may vary from year to year.</span></p></ix:continuation></div></div>
