6-42b7-4ba6-9a5c-30b7ee058286" name="us-gaap:LesseeOperatingLeaseRenewalTerm" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">10 years</span></ix:nonNumeric></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">. However, these options are not reflected in the calculation of the ROU asset and lease liability due to uncertainty surrounding the likelihood of renewal.</span></p></ix:continuation></div></div>
